C(-1)^{2}\\,⟹\\,-2=C\\,⟹\\,C=-2.\n$$\n\n- Setting $s=0,$ we have\n  \n\n$$\n4(0)+2=A(0)+B(0+1)+C(0)\\,⟹\\,2=B\\,⟹\\,B=2.\n$$\n\n- Comparing the coefficients of $s,$ we have\n \n\n$$\n4=A+B\\,⟹\\,4=A+2\\,⟹\\,A=2.\n$$\n\nThus, the decomposition is\n\n$$\nY(s)=\\frac{2}{s}+\\frac{2}{{s}^{2}}-\\frac{2}{s+1}.\n$$\n\nFrom the table of Laplace transforms, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s}} & =1 \\\\ {L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}}} & =t \\\\ {L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+1}} & ={e}^{-t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, taking the inverse Laplace transform of $Y(s),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(t) & =2{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s}}+2{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{{s}^{2}}}-2{L}^{-1}{\\frac{1}{s+1}} \\\\ y(t) & =2+2t-2{e}^{-t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376297 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376298 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376299 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376300 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376301 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1041 "field-1" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1104 #edb/ref 17592186376297 13194139535955 true] [17592186376296 1110 #uuid "274fc8d2-782a-5024-983d-e20fde8913f7" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376297 1034 "\\frac{4s+2}{{s}^{2}(s+1)}" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376297 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535955 true] [17592186376297 1111 #uuid "eda4638b-0eb4-500a-abb3-ffc275469746" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376298 1034 "\\frac{4s-2}{{s}^{2}(s+1)}" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376298 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535955 true] [17592186376298 1111 #uuid "2ebfb6d4-a39f-5714-a5c8-e1938b3dbf38" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376299 1034 "\\frac{2s+4}{{s}^{2}(s+1)}" 13194139535955 true] [17592186376299 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535955 true] [17592186376299 1111 #uuid "5eb7aa20-fb14-5fc5-aedc-da5bd